{
    "title": "Kick the Buddy\uff0dFun Action Game",
    "description": "Kick the Buddy arrives on Google Play!\r\n\r\nDive into our action game where you can explode, destroy, fire, shoot, smash, freeze and toss the buddy, all without the risk of actually killing him! You now have a virtually limitless arsenal to beat: rockets, grenades, automatic rifles, and even a nuclear bomb!\r\n\r\nWe present to you Kick the Buddy \u2014 it's more than just a fun game. It's a truly cool game. Among all stress relief games, Kick Buddy is a relaxing game where you can slap the doll and forget about your anger. It's a fun game to play when bored.\r\n\r\nKeep cool, play offline without limits, no internet or Wi-Fi required.\r\n\r\nDo you want to beat the boss, or maybe slap and bash the ragdoll?\r\nWant to smash all around you in this destroying game?\r\nWant more kicks?\r\n\r\nPERFECT METHOD OF STRESS RELIEF!\r\n\r\nEven if you're a relatively stress-free person you need to blow off steam at some point or another!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Kick the Buddy arrives on Google Play!<br><br>Dive into our action game where you can explode, destroy, fire, shoot, smash, freeze and toss the buddy, all without the risk of actually killing him! You now have a virtually limitless arsenal to beat: rockets, grenades, automatic rifles, and even a nuclear bomb!<br><br>We present to you Kick the Buddy \u2014 it&#39;s more than just a fun game. It&#39;s a truly cool game. Among all stress relief games, Kick Buddy is a relaxing game where you can slap the doll and forget about your anger. It&#39;s a fun game to play when bored.<br><br>Keep cool, play offline without limits, no internet or Wi-Fi required.<br><br>Do you want to beat the boss, or maybe slap and bash the ragdoll?<br>Want to smash all around you in this destroying game?<br>Want more kicks?<br><br>PERFECT METHOD OF STRESS RELIEF!<br><br>Even if you&#39;re a relatively stress-free person you need to blow off steam at some point or another!",
    "summary": "Smash, hit and demolish ragdoll buddy in our action game's playground. Have fun!",
